WEBVTT

00:32:25.496 --> 00:32:30.079
I'm a failure from this idea that I
was pursuing isn't going to work,

00:32:30.079 --> 00:32:32.704
which are two very obviously
different things,

00:32:32.704 --> 00:32:34.413
but don't always feel very different.

00:32:34.746 --> 00:32:39.246
I'm smiling here because you just
described that as if you've spent

00:32:39.246 --> 00:32:42.788
the past 10 years reading the psychology
of escalation of commitment,

00:32:43.246 --> 00:32:48.079
which I can't say that I have, but
maybe I've lived it a little bit.

00:32:51.454 --> 00:32:54.454
We don't need to celebrate failure.
We just need to normalize it.

00:32:55.246 --> 00:33:00.204
What you're highlighting here is that if
you had plunged more of your time,